ons in care wed be happy to show you how we can help\n\nLet me know if youd like more details or to explore how this could work for your business\n\nChris Hall\nCare Circle Network\nPart of Newscast Media Group\n',NULL,NULL,0,'https://audracare.co.uk/contact/',NULL,NULL),(11877,1005,'-','tulika kapoor','','','-','-','0','-','0','UK','07438824909','07438824909','kapoor.t.1@pg.com',0,1,1,1,1,1,1005,'2025-10-08 12:38:06',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'I need AI capability to take orders over call, chat and Email for 500 SKUs. It should be able to upsell as well.\n',NULL,NULL,0,'https://worktual.co.uk/contact/',NULL,'Lamberts Healthcare'),(11878,1366,'-','Chris','Hall','Care Circle Network','-','-','0','-','0','UK','','','hello@carecirclenetwork.co.uk',0,1,1,1,1,1,1366,'2025-10-08 13:11:20',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'Im reaching out to introduce a unique opportunity to connect directly with our engaged network of UK care homes through the Care Circle Network\n\nThe Care Circle Network has been a trusted voice in the sector for over a decade providing care home professionals with the latest news policy updates and product insights Over this time weve built a highly responsive subscriber base made up of care home owners senior managers and group procurement teamsall actively seeking relevant highquality information and solutions to support their operations\n\nWere now offering companies access to our live subscriber databasethe only one of its kind in the UK This includes realtime contact details and direct introduction routes to decisionmakers across the care home sector Its not just a listits a curated relationshipdriven network built on trust relevance and consistent engagement\n\nIf youre looking to raise awareness introduce a product or speak directly to the people making purchasing decisions in care wed be happy to show you how we can help\n\nLet me know if youd like more details or to explore how this could work for your business\n\nChris Hall\nCare Circle Network\nPart of Newscast Media Group\n',NULL,NULL,0,'https://audracare.co.uk/contact/',NULL,NULL),(11879,1366,'-','Chris','Hall','Care Circle Network','-','-','0','-','0','UK','','','hello@carecirclenetwork.co.uk',0,1,1,1,1,1,1366,'2025-10-08 14:57:50',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'Im reaching out to share a timely opportunity for compliance and quality consultants to connect directly with our engaged network of UK care homes through The Care Circle Network\n\nWith the Care Quality Commissions new Single Assessment Framework now live care homes within our network are actively seeking specialist support to review governance audit systems and inspection readiness\n\nThe Care Circle Network has been a trusted voice in the sector for over a decade reaching thousands of care home owners managers and compliance leads Our platform now gives partners access to live decisionmaker dataincluding realtime contact details and direct introduction routes to care homes preparing for inspection\n\nIf your consultancy helps care providers strengthen compliance policies or quality systems we can position your services across our network and connect you with those actively looking for guidance\n\nWould you like me to share more details on how this works\n\nBest regards\nChris Hall\nCare Circle Network\nPart of Newscast Media Group\n',NULL,NULL,0,'https://audracare.co.uk/contact/',NULL,NULL),(11880,1005,'-','Worktual test srish ','','','-','-','0','-','0','UK','8610593853','8610593853','Srishnarayanworktual@gmail.com',0,1,1,1,1,1,1005,'2025-10-09 08:53:03',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'Test',NULL,NULL,0,'https://worktual.in/contact/',NULL,'Worktual.com'),(11881,1005,'-','Worktual test srish ','','','-','-','0','-','0','UK','8610593853','8610593853','Srishn