ontacts using personal work emails, with confirmed purchasing authority or direct influence over supplier selection — precisely the roles now responsible for conducting risk assessments, applying the latest generative AI product safety standards, and ensuring compliance with safeguarding, data protection and bias requirements.\n\nThese professionals are already deeply engaged in procurement and evaluation discussions around generative AI tools for:\n\n•	reducing teacher/admin workload\n•	personalising learning and feedback\n•	improving assessment and planning\n•	supporting whole school/trust digital transformation\n\nAI-related communications we share consistently achieve 42–45% open rates — well above average — reflecting the current policy momentum, funded pilots, and genuine sector demand for trustworthy, evidence-based solutions.\n\nIf you provide generative AI solutions aligned with DfE safety expectations and are looking to connect with decision-makers who are actively researching, risk-assessing, trialling, and budgeting for these tools right now, I’d be happy to share more.\n',NULL,NULL,0,'https://worktual.co.uk/contact/',NULL,'https://schoolsupplystore.co.uk/'),(14356,1005,'-','Worktual test vetri ','','Worktual test ','-','-','0','-','0','UK','+4409080707097','+4409080707097','Vetrimk46@gmail.com',0,1,1,1,1,1,1005,'2026-02-10 17:12:33',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'',NULL,NULL,0,'https://worktual.co.uk/book-demo/',NULL,'Test.com'),(14357,1005,'-','Worktual test vetri ','','Worktual test ','-','-','0','-','0','UK','+4409080707097','+4409080707097','Vetrimk46@gmail.com',0,1,1,1,1,1,1005,'2026-02-10 17:12:59',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,'Test ',NULL,NULL,0,'https://worktual.co.uk/contact/',NULL,'Test'),(14358,1005,'-','Worktual test vetri ','','Worktual test vetri ','-','-','0','-','0','UK','+9109080707097','+9109080707097','Vetrimk46@gmail