viders right now\n\nWhere can your organisation make a practical difference at a time when providers are under pressure from rising costs regulation and operational risk\n\nAt Care Circle Network we have recently taken thousands of senior care leaders through our 2026 Care Framework  a structured 12week journey from sector pressure to practical priorities\n\nFollowing the response to the Framework we are now opening Partner Hub Supplier Spotlight features for organisations that can help care providers move from pressure to progress\n\nThe Partner Hub is Care Circles supplier insight section where we introduce care providers to suppliers who can help them respond to the pressures we are already reporting on\n\nRather than appearing as a standard advert or supplier listing your organisation can be positioned through insightled editorial connected to the issues care leaders are already reading reviewing and prioritising\n\nFor the right supplier this creates a more relevant route into the care sector  placing your message in front of senior decisionmakers as they review what support they need next\n\nWould you like to explore how this could work for your company\n',NULL,NULL,0,'https://audracare.co.uk/contact/',NULL,NULL),(15007,1366,'-','Chris','Hall','Care Circle Network','-','-','0','-','0','UK','','','chris.hall@carecirclenetwork.co.uk',0,1,1,1,1,1,1366,'2026-05-05 12:36:42',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,'What is the most important message you want to get in front of care providers right now\n\nWhere can your organisation make a practical difference at a time when providers are under pressure from rising costs regulation and operational risk\n\nAt Care Circle Network we have recently taken thousands of senior care leaders through our 2026 Care Framework  a structured 12week journey from sector pressure to practical priorities\n\nFollowing the response to the Framework we are now opening Partner Hub Supplier